 r←Test_Input_Misc_024(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms;F
⍝ Exercise "Input" with a user-defined menubar that replaces the default menubar
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Name' 'Enter your name:' ''DT.Character

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.menubar←'[Edit] {edit}' ' Cut=Ctrl+X : <cut> {cut}' ' Copy=Ctrl+C : <copy> {copy}' ' Paste=Ctrl+V : <paste> {paste}'
 parms.menubar,←'[View] {view}' ' HTML=F11 : OnView {html}' ' XML=F12 : OnView {xml}'
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢n.menubar.∆List'Menu'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 5≠≢n.menubar.∆List'MenuItem'

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
